  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zYpqnrbZy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yRY2Z3l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@dariphersmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nrx7nR1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdaripher%252fdonate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/byUOqSi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>将<strong>神化（Apotheosis）</strong>与<strong>饰品API（Curios API）</strong>模组相连接，使得任何饰品物品都能拥有<strong>神化（Apotheosis）</strong>的词缀和镶嵌槽。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>神化（Apotheosis）</strong>模组为装备物品赋予不同的词缀，例如\"+生命值\"、\"+伤害\"等。</p><p>该系统类似于《暗黑破坏神》和《流放之路》等游戏中的物品词缀系统。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>饰品API（Curios API）</strong>允许您添加新的物品槽位，例如戒指、项链等。</p><p><br><br>然而，<strong>神化（Apotheosis）</strong>模组默认无法识别这些新物品类型为装备。</p><p><strong>神化饰品（Apothic Curios）</strong>模组解决了这一问题，允许整合包开发者将词缀附加到饰品物品上。</p><p><br><br>饰品词缀示例：<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/master/src/test/resources/data/apothiccurios/affixes/ring\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></p><p><br>可在饰品上生效的宝石示例：<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/master/src/test/resources/data/apotheosis/gems\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.2版本</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/1.20.1/src/test/resources/data/apotheosis/gems\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.1版本</a></p>",
